<title>CHINA: About 22 pct of Chinese families have telephones.</title>
<headline>About 22 pct of Chinese families have telephones.</headline>
<dateline>BEIJING 1996-12-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>About 22 percent of urban families in China now have telephones, the Economic Information Daily said on Thursday.</p>
<p>It gave no further details.</p>
<p>China has said it aims to have 30-40 telephones installed for every 100 households in urban areas by the year 2000.</p>
</text>
